{"suttaId":"tha-ap76","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[4540,4556],"vripara":"13"},"segments":{"tha-ap76:0.3":"Bhisāluvadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap76:1.1":"“Kānanaṃ vanamogayha, vasāmi vipine ahaṃ;","tha-ap76:1.3":"Vipassiṃ addasaṃ buddhaṃ, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ.","tha-ap76:2.1":"“Bhisāluvañca pādāsiṃ, udakaṃ hatthadhovanaṃ;","tha-ap76:2.3":"Vanditvā sirasā pāde, pakkāmi uttarāmukho.","tha-ap76:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, bhisāluvamadaṃ tadā;","tha-ap76:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, puññakammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap76:4.1":"“Ito tatiyake kappe, bhisasammatakhattiyo;","tha-ap76:4.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap76:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap76:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā bhisāluvadāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap76:7.1":"Bhisāluvadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ.","tha-ap76:7.2":"Chaṭṭhabhāṇavāraṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2675,"to":2675,"paras":[{"para":2675,"vripara":"13","refs":["tha-ap76:1"],"words":["vasāmi vipine ahaṃ"],"lines":["So tato attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>kānanaṃ vanamoggayhā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ heṭṭhā vuttatthameva.","<b>Vasāmi vipine ahan</b>ti vivekavāso ahaṃ vasāmīti sambandho.","Sesaṃ uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap76:1"],["tha-ap76:1"],["tha-ap76:1"],["tha-ap76:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
